"How Do We Relationship?"

17
00:01:41,105 --> 00:01:44,505
(Episode 2: This Must Be Love)

18
00:01:44,525 --> 00:01:46,335
Why did you say that just now?

19
00:01:48,235 --> 00:01:51,135
