but it's no big deal.

86
00:05:23,745 --> 00:05:25,955
I just thought, "Oh, okay." That's all.

87
00:05:26,385 --> 00:05:28,145
That's probably how
most people would react.

88
00:05:28,555 --> 00:05:32,225
