89
00:05:32,495 --> 00:05:35,035
Did someone actually
say those things to you?

90
00:05:35,065 --> 00:05:36,471
If there's a jerk like that out there,

91
00:05:36,495 --> 00:05:38,535
- I'll go teach them a lesson...
- No, there isn't!

92
00:05:48,715 --> 00:05:49,715
It's just that...

93
00:05:50,745 --> 00:05:54,185
when people found out I was
dating a girl in middle school,

94
00:05:54,815 --> 00:05:56,285
the word spread.

95
00:05:57,485 --> 00:06:00,225
It wasn't so much me,
but the girl I was dating who had it worse.

96
00:06:00,325 --> 00:06:03,595
People said a lot of awful things to her
and did some really mean stuff.

97
00:06:05,865 --> 00:06:08,465
I just don't want Miwa to go through that.

98
00:06:11,435 --> 00:06:13,235
Don't worry about it.

99
00:06:13,405 --> 00:06:16,335
I'm on Saeko and Miwa's side.

100
00:06:16,605 --> 00:06:17,605
Right?

101
00:06:18,275 --> 00:06:19,945
Ouch!

102
00:06:20,045 --> 00:06:21,985
- You hit me for real just now!
- No, I didn't!

103
00:06:22,015 --> 00:06:23,015
That was close.

104
00:06:23,245 --> 00:06:25,215
My arm is going to break!

105
00:06:26,405 --> 00:06:27,405
You jerk!

106
00:06:28,855 --> 00:06:29,855
Hey, so...

107
00:06:31,225 --> 00:06:34,385
We're actually dating.

108
00:06:36,325 --> 00:06:37,325
