135
00:08:10,765 --> 00:08:13,824
- Here.
- Wow, the tuna looks delicious!

136
00:08:13,825 --> 00:08:15,755
- Looks great, right?
- Yeah!

137
00:08:17,365 --> 00:08:22,304
- So, once again, happy...
- One-month anniversary!

138
00:08:22,305 --> 00:08:24,335
