schooler's report card?

150
00:09:02,435 --> 00:09:08,515
Then what do you like about me, Saeko?

151
00:09:08,745 --> 00:09:09,945
Huh?

152
00:09:10,525 --> 00:09:11,885
Hmm...

153
00:09:13,385 --> 00:09:14,405
Everything?

154
00:09:14,555 --> 00:09:16,685
That's such a cop-out!

155
00:09:16,715 --> 00:09:17,944
No, it's not.

156
00:09:17,945 --> 00:09:18,685
It totally is.

157
00:09:18,686 --> 00:09:19,805
I'm telling the truth!

158
00:09:19,825 --> 00:09:22,124
As punishment,
I'm confiscating a piece of tuna.

159
00:09:22,125 --> 00:09:23,945
Hey, wait!

160
