Huh?

164
00:09:44,885 --> 00:09:47,245
I'm always sweet, okay?

165
00:09:52,455 --> 00:09:53,455
So good.

166
00:09:55,685 --> 00:09:57,865
Time really flies when you're having fun.

167
00:09:58,725 --> 00:10:00,165
Yeah.

168
00:10:01,365 --> 00:10:02,365
So cute.

169
00:10:08,835 --> 00:10:09,835
Huh?

170
00:10:09,875 --> 00:10:11,375
We don't go this way, do we?

171
00:10:11,865 --> 00:10:12,884
Huh?

172
00:10:12,885 --> 00:10:14,615
No, it's this way.

173
00:10:14,645 --> 00:10:15,645
No, it's not.

174
00:10:16,375 --> 00:10:17,915
The station is over there.

175
00:10:18,515 --> 00:10:19,515
No...

176
00:10:19,745 --> 00:10:20,945
Um...

177
00:10:26,045 --> 00:10:28,755
I want to go in here.

178
00:10:34,165 --> 00:10:36,165
This is...

179
00:10:38,065 --> 00:10:39,225
I want to do it.

180
00:10:39,565 --> 00:10:41,045
I want to do it with you today, Miwa.

181
00:10:44,165 --> 00:10:45,165
Huh?

182
00:10:45,545 --> 00:10:47,575
Isn't this way too fast?

183
00:10:47,645 --> 00:10:49,345
We've only been dating for a month.

184
00:10:49,375 --> 00:10:50,945
It's already been a month.

185
00:10:50,985 --> 00:10:53,385
I feel like I've waited long enough.

186
00:10:55,615 --> 00:11:00,185
Anyway, today...
I'm just not mentally prepared for this...

187
00:11:00,385 --> 00:11:01,825
Then when will you be ready?

188
00:11:02,725 --> 00:11:03,725
Uh...

189
00:11:04,285 --> 00:11:06,925
When... um...

190
00:11:14,805 --> 00:11:15,905
I get it.

191
00:11:16,235 --> 00:11:17,675
Let's just forget about it today.

192
00:11:17,845 --> 00:11:18,905
Let's go home.

193
00:11:21,865 --> 00:11:23,745
I'm sorry...

194
00:11:23,775 --> 00:11:25,044
It's fine.

195
00:11:25,045 --> 00:11:27,605
Besides, this isn't something
you should be apologizing for.

196
00:11:27,665 --> 00:11:28,665
Let's go.

197
00:11:33,825 --> 00:11:37,625
And so, we just went home that day.

198
00:11:38,625 --> 00:11:42,694
How long do normal couples date

199
