before they do that kind of thing?

200
00:11:45,965 --> 00:11:47,465
Hmm...

201
00:11:47,965 --> 00:11:52,275
Personally, I'd totally do it even
if we weren't officially dating.

202
00:11:52,625 --> 00:11:55,445
Okay, okay. There are definitely
people like you out there...

203
00:11:55,675 --> 00:11:59,445
But there's no rule saying you
have to wait a few months, right?

204
00:11:59,565 --> 00:12:01,544
You should just do it
when both of you want to.

205
00:12:01,545 --> 00:12:04,465
But we're talking about Saeko here.

206
00:12:04,545 --> 00:12:07,454
Can she really hold back?

207
00:12:07,455 --> 00:12:07,945
Huh?

208
00:12:07,946 --> 00:12:10,945
I feel like Saeko would
make a move pretty quickly.

209
00:12:11,125 --> 00:12:14,894
Besides, if it were me, if I couldn't
have sex with the person I like,

210
00:12:14,895 --> 00:12:18,265
then there'd be no point in dating.

211
00:12:18,605 --> 00:12:20,505
No point in dating...

212
00:12:20,605 --> 00:12:21,705
Hey, Rika.

213
00:12:21,935 --> 00:12:24,251
If it were me, I'd want to touch
them as long as I like them.

214
00:12:24,275 --> 00:12:28,045
