216
00:12:29,735 --> 00:12:30,615
No way.

217
00:12:30,616 --> 00:12:32,385
Why not? You definitely would.

218
00:12:32,415 --> 00:12:33,415
I...

219
00:12:34,075 --> 00:12:37,115
Did I trample all over Saeko's feelings?

220
00:12:37,935 --> 00:12:41,124
Um... That's just my
personal opinion, okay?

221
00:12:41,125 --> 00:12:43,695
I'm the worst.

222
00:12:50,595 --> 00:12:52,281
We should definitely
go to the beach, right?

223
00:12:52,305 --> 00:12:54,335
Wait, you don't have other plans, do you?

224
00:12:54,775 --> 00:12:56,005
Yeah... I guess.

225
00:12:56,035 --> 00:12:58,105
I really want to go to the beach.

226
00:12:59,445 --> 00:13:01,945
But I heard the summer
training camp is mandatory.

227
00:13:04,585 --> 00:13:05,485
You're kidding, right?

228
00:13:05,485 --> 00:13:06,335
I'm serious.

229
00:13:06,336 --> 00:13:08,685
Whoa, seriously?

230
00:13:08,895 --> 00:13:12,555
I was planning to go on a trip
with my girlfriend. Now that's ruined.

231
00:13:12,625 --> 00:13:14,955
Huh? You have a girlfriend, Lucha?

232
00:13:16,355 --> 00:13:18,894
As a matter of fact, I do!

233
00:13:18,895 --> 00:13:19,895
Wanna see?

234
00:13:20,275 --> 00:13:22,295
- Nope.
- Come on, just look.

235
00:13:22,335 --> 00:13:23,575
- No... That's too close.
- Look closely.

236
00:13:23,595 --> 00:13:25,705
Come on, come on, take a look.

237
00:13:25,755 --> 00:13:26,755
See?

238
00:13:28,575 --> 00:13:29,695
How have things been lately?

239
00:13:29,975 --> 00:13:33,705
Has Saeko been all lovey-dovey lately?

240
00:13:34,415 --> 00:13:36,745
We're doing pretty
well. Just normal, I guess.

241
00:13:38,115 --> 00:13:43,955
But... lately it feels like
we're a bit out of sync.

242
00:13:44,625 --> 00:13:45,455
Huh?

243
00:13:45,575 --> 00:13:47,375
Like the attempted sex
incident, for example.

244
00:13:47,455 --> 00:13:49,395
Attempted sex incident!?

245
00:13:49,955 --> 00:13:51,425
What the heck are you doing?

246
00:13:51,725 --> 00:13:54,114
Is this something we should be hearing?

247
00:13:54,115 --> 00:13:56,765
It doesn't matter.
It's not a big deal anyway.

248
00:13:57,165 --> 00:14:01,475
It's just... I feel like we're
being too polite to each other.

249
00:14:02,875 --> 00:14:04,075
You see, Miwa...

250
00:14:04,375 --> 00:14:09,415
Whenever she's trying to read my mood, she
stares at me with these total puppy-dog eyes.

251
00:14:10,375 --> 00:14:11,385
How should I put it?

252
00:14:11,415 --> 00:14:14,955
It makes me feel like
I've done something wrong.

253
00:14:19,675 --> 00:14:27,195
Saeko, don't tell me you
find Miwa a bit annoying?

254
00:14:28,695 --> 00:14:31,764
No, no, no, not at all.

255
00:14:31,765 --> 00:14:32,904
- It's not to that extent...
- I get it, I get it.

256
00:14:32,905 --> 00:14:33,705
- No, no.
- Totally get it.

257
00:14:33,705 --> 00:14:34,705
Ah, Miwa.

258
00:14:38,305 --> 00:14:40,775
Mi... Miwa.

259
00:14:41,895 --> 00:14:42,895
Miwa...

260
00:14:43,445 --> 00:14:45,115
Did you hear that just now?

261
00:14:46,045 --> 00:14:47,245
I heard it...

262
00:14:48,375 --> 00:14:51,585
You think I'm annoying, right?

263
00:14:53,035 --> 00:14:53,885
No...

264
00:14:53,925 --> 00:14:56,195
Um... Well...

265
00:14:57,595 --> 00:14:59,395
Ah, Miwa!

266
00:15:02,865 --> 00:15:05,505
Hey, what do we do now?

267
00:15:05,805 --> 00:15:06,805
Huh?

268
00:15:09,455 --> 00:15:11,645
I just thought of a great idea.

269
00:15:14,375 --> 00:15:15,375
Uh...

270
00:15:16,175 --> 00:15:17,175
Um...

271
00:15:17,915 --> 00:15:22,015
Ah, the weather is really nice today...

272
00:15:23,385 --> 00:15:24,385
Yeah...

273
00:15:24,535 --> 00:15:26,425
- It really is...
- Yeah...

274
00:15:29,881 --> 00:15:31,735
[Light Music Group]

275
00:15:31,855 --> 00:15:32,855
That's weird.

276
00:15:33,265 --> 00:15:35,165
Looks like no one else is here yet?

277
00:15:38,765 --> 00:15:40,035
Huh? What?

278
00:15:40,695 --> 00:15:46,075
This is the 'You Can't Leave
Until You Make Up' room.

279
00:15:46,345 --> 00:15:47,345
Huh?

280
00:15:47,415 --> 00:15:51,215
So that's the deal.
Alright, good luck.

281
00:15:51,785 --> 00:15:53,214
What?

282
00:15:53,215 --> 00:15:55,515
Wait...

283
00:15:57,385 --> 00:15:59,825
Go get 'em!

284
00:15:59,855 --> 00:16:01,495
This is your great idea?

285
00:16:01,695 --> 00:16:05,765
Hey, don't press yourselves so close.

286
00:16:05,825 --> 00:16:07,725
Are they idiots?

287
00:16:08,475 --> 00:16:10,195
What on earth are they thinking?

288
00:16:22,515 --> 00:16:23,515
Miwa.

289
00:16:23,935 --> 00:16:24,935
Um...

290
00:16:25,795 --> 00:16:27,585
You're still mad, aren't you?

291
00:16:27,855 --> 00:16:28,885
About yesterday.

292
00:16:30,785 --> 00:16:31,785
No.

293
00:16:33,025 --> 00:16:34,195
I'm not mad.

294
00:16:34,855 --> 00:16:36,325
Liar.

295
00:16:38,775 --> 00:16:43,665
Of course, it still hurt.

296
00:16:44,875 --> 00:16:45,875
But...

297
00:16:47,135 --> 00:16:51,505
Since we're dating, having one or two
things you don't like about the other person

298
00:16:51,805 --> 00:16:54,305
is pretty normal, isn't it?

299
00:16:56,245 --> 00:16:57,635
If anything,

300
00:16:58,245 --> 00:17:02,215
on our anniversary,

301
00:17:03,095 --> 00:17:10,195
did I hurt Saeko's feelings and pride?

302
00:17:10,425 --> 00:17:12,925
What are you talking
about? You're overthinking it.

303
00:17:14,665 --> 00:17:15,835
I...

304
00:17:16,265 --> 00:17:19,535
If Saeko wants to do it,
I'll do my best.

305
00:17:19,975 --> 00:17:23,105
Huh? What are you saying?
What kind of declaration is that?

306
00:17:23,321 --> 00:17:25,061
I've already mentally prepared myself.

307
00:17:25,845 --> 00:17:27,685
If it's for Saeko, I'm
willing to do anything.

308
00:17:30,845 --> 00:17:32,645
Listen,

309
00:17:33,255 --> 00:17:37,415
how could I possibly sleep with a girl
making a face like that?

310
00:17:37,785 --> 00:17:38,785
Hey.

311
00:17:39,655 --> 00:17:40,655
What?

312
00:17:40,935 --> 00:17:42,155
You look like an octopus.

313
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:44,495
What octopus...

314
00:17:45,315 --> 00:17:47,595
I'm being completely serious here.

315
00:17:48,235 --> 00:17:52,595
Ah, is this what you hate about me?

316
00:17:53,435 --> 00:17:57,905
If I had to say, it's how you're
so careless about a lot of things.

317
00:17:58,105 --> 00:18:00,144
And how you get carried away so easily.

318
00:18:00,145 --> 00:18:02,475
That's so mean.

319
00:18:02,545 --> 00:18:05,114
And that flippant attitude of yours...

320
00:18:05,115 --> 00:18:05,845
Hey...

321
00:18:05,846 --> 00:18:08,886
Plus, you're totally unromantic. I
might actually really hate that about you.

322
00:18:11,185 --> 00:18:12,185
I...

323
00:18:13,815 --> 00:18:19,595
might still find you annoying
sometimes in the future.

324
00:18:20,225 --> 00:18:23,465
But... including all of that,

325
00:18:24,195 --> 00:18:25,265
Um... cu...

326
00:18:38,065 --> 00:18:40,015
I think you're cute.

327
00:18:41,215 --> 00:18:44,725
I think everything about you is cute.

328
00:18:48,325 --> 00:18:49,555
Liar.

329
00:18:50,225 --> 00:18:51,895
I said you're cute.

330
00:18:53,495 --> 00:18:54,635
Really cute.

331
00:19:06,745 --> 00:19:07,745
Oh...

332
00:19:09,275 --> 00:19:11,185
Oh my, oh my.
Don't mind us, just ignore us.

333
00:19:11,325 --> 00:19:12,905
Please continue.

334
00:19:12,925 --> 00:19:15,165
- Please, please, please.
- Like we could continue!

335
00:19:24,185 --> 00:19:25,565
Sorry to intrude.

336
00:19:25,965 --> 00:19:26,965
Whoa.

337
00:19:27,625 --> 00:19:29,165
You keep this place so clean.

338
00:19:30,185 --> 00:19:33,705
It feels pretty mature.

339
00:19:38,385 --> 00:19:39,385
Um...

340
00:19:43,045 --> 00:19:45,904
Do you want to just stay over tonight?

341
00:19:45,905 --> 00:19:47,744
Huh? Really?

342
00:19:47,745 --> 00:19:49,685
Awesome.

343
00:19:53,765 --> 00:19:55,755
That's not what I meant...

344
00:19:57,345 --> 00:19:58,345
Hm?

345
00:19:59,385 --> 00:20:04,095
I mean... if it's okay today,
do you want to do it...?

346
00:20:04,565 --> 00:20:05,565
Huh?

347
00:20:06,365 --> 00:20:09,575
Why so sudden?

348
00:20:09,965 --> 00:20:17,345
Because... didn't you say
everything about me is cute?

349
00:20:34,525 --> 00:20:36,235
Are you still scared after all?

350
00:20:40,205 --> 00:20:42,075
It's... it's weird, right?

351
00:20:42,735 --> 00:20:47,575
Even though I know there's
no need to be scared, but...

352
00:20:56,125 --> 00:20:57,125
Miwa.

353
00:20:57,565 --> 00:20:59,325
Do you even have a sex drive to begin with?

354
00:21:00,165 --> 00:21:01,165
What?

355
00:21:01,755 --> 00:21:03,894
You really are totally unromantic.

356
00:21:03,895 --> 00:21:06,825
No, this is more important
than romance, right?

357
00:21:06,885 --> 00:21:09,965
If you don't have a sex drive at all,
how could I possibly force you to do it?

358
00:21:18,505 --> 00:21:20,305
I do.

359
00:21:21,285 --> 00:21:23,345
To be honest, I really do.

360
00:21:23,625 --> 00:21:27,485
When we first started dating, I
wanted to sleep with you so badly.

361
00:21:28,225 --> 00:21:29,225
Wait.

362
00:21:30,685 --> 00:21:31,755
I said my piece.

363
00:21:32,805 --> 00:21:33,925
What about you, Miwa?

364
00:21:39,865 --> 00:21:42,265
It's... it's not like I have none at all.

365
00:21:43,465 --> 00:21:44,624
What does that mean?

366
00:21:44,625 --> 00:21:46,035
So you do have one?

367
00:21:46,265 --> 00:21:47,265
Huh?

368
00:21:47,465 --> 00:21:48,465
Hm?

369
00:21:52,875 --> 00:21:56,475
Actually, I'm scared of doing that...

370
00:21:56,775 --> 00:22:00,145
Partly because it's my first time.

371
00:22:01,285 --> 00:22:02,285
But...

372
00:22:04,125 --> 00:22:05,125
But?

373
00:22:06,185 --> 00:22:08,755
I'm afraid that once the switch is flipped,

374
00:22:09,255 --> 00:22:11,565
I won't be able to control myself at all...

375
00:22:13,195 --> 00:22:14,265
So I'm scared.

376
00:22:18,485 --> 00:22:19,965
That sounds so dirty.

377
00:22:20,265 --> 00:22:22,625
Jeez, I told you not
to say things like that.

378
00:22:23,205 --> 00:22:24,624
Where is this switch?

379
00:22:24,625 --> 00:22:26,105
Here? Here?

380
00:22:26,675 --> 00:22:27,914
Is it here?

381
00:22:27,915 --> 00:22:29,814
Wait, stop it.

382
00:22:29,815 --> 00:22:31,245
I said it tickles.

383
00:22:32,545 --> 00:22:34,215
Jeez, stop it already.

384
00:23:01,475 --> 00:23:02,515
Miwa.

385
00:23:03,975 --> 00:23:05,945
I want all of you.

386
00:23:08,365 --> 00:23:11,855
I want to make everything about Miwa
mine.

387
00:23:19,465 --> 00:23:20,465
Yeah...

388
00:23:22,505 --> 00:23:23,505
Okay.

389
00:23:42,085 --> 00:23:44,085
It's okay, Miwa, you don't have to move.

390
00:23:50,555 --> 00:23:53,225
(Next Episode Preview)
Miwa, do you get jealous?

391
00:23:54,795 --> 00:23:56,144
Don't you get envious?

392
00:23:56,145 --> 00:23:58,044
Hello. I'm an intense yet
straightforward person.

393
00:23:58,045 --> 00:24:00,135
You have to protect your own body.

394
00:24:00,165 --> 00:24:02,304
Why did you suddenly push me away?

395
00:24:02,305 --> 00:24:04,675
It's so nice that Miwa
can be so honest about it.

396
00:24:04,999 --> 00:24:06,999
MkvDrama.net

